SC,0004
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1793651056
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AIf hackers can take control of a
OL,4,Asupermarket freezer, how vulnerable is
OL,5,Aother tech?
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnd while that makes them easier to
OL,8,Fcontrol remotely, in theory, any device
OL,9,Fwhich goes online can potentially be
OL,10,Fexploited by malicious actors.
OL,12,FHowever, that doesn't mean hackers can
OL,13,Feasily take control of it, and big
OL,14,Fbrands generally go to great lengths to
OL,15,Fmake sure their tech is secure.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/18
