OL,3,ABinance users withdraw $3.6bn after
OL,4,Alargest-ever crypto hack
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company said it has covered around
OL,7,F95% of the assets stolen in the breach
OL,8,Fbut the remaining amount may take
OL,9,Flonger to source. Binance has
OL,10,Frepeatedly said it would cover all of
OL,11,Fthe losses linked to the attack.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/18
